  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the Government of Colombia&apos;s program to manage risks resulting from climate, disaster and public health shocks at subnational level and across key sectors by (i) improving access to financial instruments and (ii) promoting resilience and climate change adaptation.</narrative>
